### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@email = admin1@homelab.local
@password = securepassword123


### ========================================
### AUTH
### ========================================

### Sign up
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### Sign in
# @name signIn
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### Get current session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/get-session
Origin: {{origin}}


### Sign out
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-out
Origin: {{origin}}

### ========================================
### FEEDS
### ========================================

### List all feeds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds
Origin: {{origin}}


### List feeds filtered by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds?status=active
Origin: {{origin}}


### Get a single feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds/<FEED_ID>
Origin: {{origin}}


### Add a new feed
# @name createFeed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "url": "https://feeds.feedburner.com/ndtvnews-top-stories",
  "refreshInterval": "30m"
}


### Add a feed — validation error (bad URL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "url": "not-a-url",
  "refreshInterval": "30m"
}


### VALIDATION ERROR (interval too short) - Add a feed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "url": "https://feeds.feedburner.com/TheHackersNews",
  "refreshInterval": "1m"
}

### VALIDATION ERROR (url not valid) - Add a feed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "url": "https://feeds.feedburner.com/TheHackersNewsss",
  "refreshInterval": "100m"
}

### Trigger manual refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds/refresh/<FEED_ID>
Origin: {{origin}}


### Delete a feed
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/feeds/<FEED_ID>
Origin: {{origin}}
